  "text8": {
   "type": "text",
   "layout": {
    "width": {
     "fill": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "style": {
     "from": "heading2Wide"
    },
    "text": "Why one queue"
   }
  },
  "text9": {
   "type": "text",
   "layout": {
    "width": {
     "fill": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "style": {
     "from": "bodyWide"
    },
    "text": "For years every team ran its own broker. Each one had its own retry rules, its own dashboards and its own way of failing at three in the morning. When we counted, forty services were publishing to nine different systems, and nobody could say where a given message had been."
   }
  },
  "text10": {
   "type": "text",
   "layout": {
    "width": {
     "fill": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "style": {
     "from": "bodyWide"
    },
    "text": "Consolidating looked like a risky bet. A single queue becomes a single point of failure, and a noisy neighbour can starve everyone else. We decided the operational clarity was worth it, as long as we could isolate workloads properly."
   }
  },
  "column11": {
   "type": "column",
   "layout": {
    "padding": [
     24,
     8,
     8,
     8
    ],
    "width": {
     "fill": 0
    },
    "height": {
     "hug": 0
    }
   },
   "props": {
    "spacing": 8,
    "crossAxisAlignment": "start"
   },
   "decoration": {
    "strokes": [
